WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.955 --> 00:00:06.688
&gt;&gt; Emily: BERNIE SANDERS GOING

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:09.124
ALL IN ON HIS CONTROVERSIAL PLAN

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:10.358
TO LET FELONS INCLUDING

00:00:10.359 --> 00:00:11.026
TERRORISTS LIKE THE BOSTON

00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:12.727
BOMBER VOTE FROM PRISON.

00:00:12.728 --> 00:00:15.130
BERNIE TAKING IT EVEN FURTHER

00:00:15.131 --> 00:00:15.797
WITH THESE COMPARISONS.

00:00:15.798 --> 00:00:19.734
&gt;&gt; I SAID THAT BECAUSE THE RIGHT

00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:20.902
TO VOTE IS ESSENTIAL.

00:00:20.903 --> 00:00:22.437
IF YOU ARE A CITIZEN, YOU HAVE

00:00:22.438 --> 00:00:25.173
THE RIGHT TO VOTE.

00:00:25.174 --> 00:00:27.008
THAT IS A RIGHT WE MUST PROTECT

00:00:27.009 --> 00:00:29.311
BECAUSE WE KNOW THE HISTORY OF

00:00:29.312 --> 00:00:30.745
THIS COUNTRY.

00:00:30.746 --> 00:00:33.515
WE KNOW THAT WOMEN DIDN'T HAVE

00:00:33.516 --> 00:00:34.616
THE RIGHT TO VOTE.

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:35.584
WE KNOW THAT AFRICAN-AMERICANS

00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:38.186
DIDN'T HAVE THE RIGHT TO VOTE.

00:00:38.187 --> 00:00:40.355
&gt;&gt; Emily: SANDERS IS ALSO

00:00:40.356 --> 00:00:40.956
SLAMMING A FLORIDA BILL

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:42.757
REQUIRING FELONS TO PAY COURT

00:00:42.758 --> 00:00:44.526
FEES BEFORE BECOMING ELIGIBLE TO

00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:45.794
VOTE AS "RACIST AND

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:48.663
UNCONSTITUTIONAL."

00:00:48.664 --> 00:00:50.398
&gt;&gt; Dana: WE DID THE

00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:51.099
FRUSTRATING THING YESTERDAY.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.168
THOSE ARE TWO DIFFERENT THINGS.

00:00:53.169 --> 00:00:54.369
WHILE BERNIE SANDERS IS TALKING

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.403
ABOUT IS PEOPLE IN PRISON BEING

00:00:55.404 --> 00:00:56.738
ALLOWED TO VOTE.

00:00:56.739 --> 00:00:57.439
THE THING IN FLORIDA IS NOT

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.740
GOOD.

00:00:58.741 --> 00:01:01.142
IT'S A BILL THAT'S PASSED BY THE

00:01:01.143 --> 00:01:02.143
HOUSE VERSION, STATE SENATE

00:01:02.144 --> 00:01:04.746
VERSION IS DIFFERENT.

00:01:04.747 --> 00:01:06.681
IT'S FOR PEOPLE WHO'VE GOTTEN

00:01:06.682 --> 00:01:07.782
OUT OF PRISON WHO HAVE PAID

00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:08.383
THEIR DEBT TO SOCIETY.

00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:09.985
THEY ARE OUT OF PRISON AND THEY

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:10.752
ARE TRYING TO PUT ADDITIONAL

00:01:10.753 --> 00:01:11.920
CONSTRAINTS ON THEM.

00:01:11.921 --> 00:01:14.322
THAT IS A SEPARATE TOPIC FROM

00:01:14.323 --> 00:01:15.423
WHAT BERNIE SANDERS IS TALKING

00:01:15.424 --> 00:01:15.724
ABOUT.

00:01:15.725 --> 00:01:16.524
SORRY.

00:01:16.525 --> 00:01:18.159
&gt;&gt; Juan: HERE'S MY POINT TO

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:18.927
YOU.

00:01:18.928 --> 00:01:19.728
BERNIE SANDERS IS MOVING THIS

00:01:19.729 --> 00:01:21.997
CONVERSATION INCREMENTALLY.

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:23.598
YOU DON'T WANT TO HEAR IT.

00:01:23.599 --> 00:01:24.366
&gt;&gt; Dana: THAT'S NOT TRUE.

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:28.536
I'M NOT GOING TO TAKE A BACKSEAT

00:01:28.537 --> 00:01:30.505
ON FALLON VOTING RIGHTS.

00:01:30.506 --> 00:01:32.807
I'M TALKING ABOUT FROM THE

00:01:32.808 --> 00:01:33.341
BEGINNING.

00:01:33.342 --> 00:01:34.075
RESTORING FALLON VOTING RIGHTS

00:01:34.076 --> 00:01:36.177
ONCE THEY GET OUT OF PRISON,

00:01:36.178 --> 00:01:36.511
YES.

00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:37.379
BUT THAT'S NOT WHAT

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.380
BERNIE SANDERS IS TALKING ABOUT.

00:01:38.381 --> 00:01:39.414
THAT WASN'T THE INITIAL THING

00:01:39.415 --> 00:01:40.982
THE OTHER DAY.

00:01:40.983 --> 00:01:42.617
AND HIM MOVING THE CONVERSATION

00:01:42.618 --> 00:01:43.918
INCREMENTALLY IS TRY TO SAVE

00:01:43.919 --> 00:01:45.353
FACE FROM HAPPENING THE OTHER

00:01:45.354 --> 00:01:46.354
DAY BECAUSE THE ENTIRE

00:01:46.355 --> 00:01:47.555
DEMOCRATIC PARTY IS LIKE WHAT

00:01:47.556 --> 00:01:48.490
DID HE SAY?

00:01:48.491 --> 00:01:49.491
I WONDER WHAT JOE BIDEN WILL

00:01:49.492 --> 00:01:49.758
SAY.

00:01:49.759 --> 00:01:51.793
I BET HE WILL HAVE A BETTER

00:01:51.794 --> 00:01:52.127
ANSWER.

00:01:52.128 --> 00:01:53.795
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THINK HE MIGHT HAVE

00:01:53.796 --> 00:01:55.196
A DIFFERENT ANSWER BUT IT'S A

00:01:55.197 --> 00:01:56.297
CONVERSATION STARTER.

00:01:56.298 --> 00:01:58.433
EVERYONE IS TALKING ABOUT IT,

00:01:58.434 --> 00:01:58.733
DANA.

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:01.202
&gt;&gt; Greg: WHEN DANA GETS THAT

00:02:01.203 --> 00:02:02.737
MAD.

00:02:02.738 --> 00:02:03.338
TAKE THE L.

00:02:03.339 --> 00:02:04.039
&gt;&gt; Juan: EVERYONE IS TALKING

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.074
ABOUT IT.

00:02:06.075 --> 00:02:08.276
TO SAY BERNIE, YOU'VE DONE

00:02:08.277 --> 00:02:09.511
SOMETHING HERE BECAUSE LOTS OF

00:02:09.512 --> 00:02:10.111
PEOPLE --

00:02:10.112 --> 00:02:11.846
&gt;&gt; Jesse: LET'S GIVE BERNIE A

00:02:11.847 --> 00:02:12.380
ROUND OF APPLAUSE.

00:02:12.381 --> 00:02:15.183
LET THE BOSTON BOMBER VOTE.

00:02:15.184 --> 00:02:15.717
GOOD JOB, BERNIE.

00:02:15.718 --> 00:02:17.585
&gt;&gt; Dana: THE MAYOR OF BOSTON

00:02:17.586 --> 00:02:20.822
IS LIKE WHAT IS HE TALKING ABOU

00:02:20.823 --> 00:02:21.122
ABOUT?

00:02:21.123 --> 00:02:23.258
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU ACT AS IF AMERICA

00:02:23.259 --> 00:02:24.759
ISN'T HAVING THIS CONVERSATION.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:27.028
&gt;&gt; Greg: AMERICA --

00:02:27.029 --> 00:02:29.998
THEY ARE NOT.

00:02:29.999 --> 00:02:33.935
I GUARANTEE YOU THERE'S NO ONE

00:02:33.936 --> 00:02:35.370
TALKING ABOUT IT.

00:02:35.371 --> 00:02:36.571
YOU KNOW, THE BOSTON BOMBER

00:02:36.572 --> 00:02:38.973
REALLY SHOULD VOTE IN THE NEXT

00:02:38.974 --> 00:02:40.508
ELECTION.

00:02:40.509 --> 00:02:41.109
MAY BE RUN PRESIDENT.

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:44.312
HE COULD BE OF AGGRESSIVE

00:02:44.313 --> 00:02:44.813
CANDIDATE.

00:02:44.814 --> 00:02:46.214
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU CAN MAKE A

00:02:46.215 --> 00:02:46.614
CARICATURE.

00:02:46.615 --> 00:02:47.649
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DON'T HAVE TO!

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.918
YOU ARE DOING IT.

00:02:49.919 --> 00:02:51.786
&gt;&gt; Juan: IS AN APPOINTMENT

00:02:51.787 --> 00:02:53.288
PART TO BE MADE ABOUT

00:02:53.289 --> 00:02:54.289
CITIZENSHIP.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:56.591
BERNIE, EARL WARREN, THE FORMER

00:02:56.592 --> 00:02:57.325
CHIEF JUSTICE SAY YOU DON'T BE

00:02:57.326 --> 00:02:59.294
CITIZENSHIP ON --

00:02:59.295 --> 00:03:01.730
&gt;&gt; Greg: NOW YOU ARE ARGUING

00:03:01.731 --> 00:03:02.597
THE POINT.

00:03:02.598 --> 00:03:05.567
&gt;&gt; Juan: THE SAME POINT.

00:03:05.568 --> 00:03:07.268
&gt;&gt; Jesse: LET'S ARGUE THE

00:03:07.269 --> 00:03:07.569
POINT.

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.137
DO YOU THINK THE BOSTON BOMBER

00:03:09.138 --> 00:03:11.673
SHOULD BE ABLE TO VOTE IN 2020?

00:03:11.674 --> 00:03:12.640
&gt;&gt; Juan: DO I THINK?

00:03:12.641 --> 00:03:15.276
I HAVEN'T CONSIDERED.

00:03:15.277 --> 00:03:16.344
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WE HAVE BEEN DOING

00:03:16.345 --> 00:03:17.979
THIS SEGMENT FOR TWO DAYS.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:19.180
ANSWER THE QUESTION.

00:03:19.181 --> 00:03:20.415
YES OR NO.

00:03:20.416 --> 00:03:21.916
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THINK YOUR

00:03:21.917 --> 00:03:23.017
CITIZENSHIP RIGHTS ARE NOT TO BE

00:03:23.018 --> 00:03:25.987
REVOKED BECAUSE YOU DON'T LIKE

00:03:25.988 --> 00:03:26.254
ME.

00:03:26.255 --> 00:03:29.357
&gt;&gt; Dana: WHAT IF YOU KILL ME?

00:03:29.358 --> 00:03:31.159
&gt;&gt; Greg: AND THEY HAVE GUNS IN

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.327
PRISON TOO?

00:03:32.328 --> 00:03:33.595
IT'S A SECOND AMENDMENT RIGHT.

00:03:33.596 --> 00:03:35.330
MAYBE HE COULD HAVE A GUN.

00:03:35.331 --> 00:03:38.733
ALL INMATES HAVE GUNS.

00:03:38.734 --> 00:03:39.167
GUTFELD 2020.

00:03:39.168 --> 00:03:40.835
&gt;&gt; Juan: 22 STATES WILL

00:03:40.836 --> 00:03:43.638
RESTORE A FELONS VOTING RIGHTS

00:03:43.639 --> 00:03:45.640
AFTER, FOR A PERIOD AFTER.

00:03:45.641 --> 00:03:47.876
YOU HAVE 14 STATES THAT SAY YOU

00:03:47.877 --> 00:03:51.112
LOSE YOUR RIGHTS.

00:03:51.113 --> 00:03:53.148
&gt;&gt; Emily: WE HAVE BEEN TALKING

00:03:53.149 --> 00:03:53.815
ABOUT THIS FOR THREE DAYS.

00:03:53.816 --> 00:03:56.284
AS YOU KNOW, I SPEND A LOT OF

00:03:56.285 --> 00:03:57.085
TIME WITH INMATES AND I

00:03:57.086 --> 00:03:58.486
CORRESPOND WITH THEM.

00:03:58.487 --> 00:03:59.721
I'VE GOTTEN A LOT OF EMAILS FROM

00:03:59.722 --> 00:04:01.156
THEM IN THE LAST TWO DAYS.

00:04:01.157 --> 00:04:03.324
FIRST OF ALL, THEY WATCH THEIR

00:04:03.325 --> 00:04:03.625
SHOW.

00:04:03.626 --> 00:04:06.361
&gt;&gt; Greg: DO THEY LIKE ANIMALS

00:04:06.362 --> 00:04:07.362
ARE GREAT?

00:04:07.363 --> 00:04:10.331
&gt;&gt; Dana: DO THEY LIKE CORNY

00:04:10.332 --> 00:04:13.368
JOKES?

00:04:13.369 --> 00:04:14.769
&gt;&gt; Greg: THEY SHOULDN'T BE

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:15.570
WATCHING "THE FIVE."

00:04:15.571 --> 00:04:17.338
IT'S A RIGHT THAT SHOULD BE

00:04:17.339 --> 00:04:17.739
DEPRIVED.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.340
&gt;&gt; Dana: WE WANT THEM TO WATCH

00:04:19.341 --> 00:04:19.741
"THE FIVE."

00:04:19.742 --> 00:04:21.142
&gt;&gt; Greg: WE DON'T NEED THE

00:04:21.143 --> 00:04:21.476
RATINGS.

00:04:21.477 --> 00:04:23.812
WE ARE NUMBER ONE IN THE

00:04:23.813 --> 00:04:24.479
COUNTRY.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:26.147
&gt;&gt; Emily: THEY ARE PEOPLE TOO.

00:04:26.148 --> 00:04:27.649
HERE'S THE POINT.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.485
THERE'S THREE SECTIONS OF THIS

00:04:30.486 --> 00:04:30.919
CONVERSATION.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:34.322
THERE IS THE VIOLENT TERRORISTS

00:04:34.323 --> 00:04:34.856
VOTING FROM PRISON.

00:04:34.857 --> 00:04:36.491
THERE IS THE INCARCERATED

00:04:36.492 --> 00:04:37.725
NONVIOLENT OFFENDERS THAT REALLY

00:04:37.726 --> 00:04:39.360
THIS CONVERSATION IS ABOUT.

00:04:39.361 --> 00:04:40.528
AND POST-INCARCERATION, SUBJECT

00:04:40.529 --> 00:04:43.298
TO FINES AND EVERYTHING WHICH IS

00:04:43.299 --> 00:04:44.666
RIDICULOUS, SECONDARY

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:45.099
IMPRISONMENT.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:46.000
MY POINT IS THAT THERE'S A LOT

00:04:46.001 --> 00:04:46.868
OF SENTIMENT THAT IN THE

00:04:46.869 --> 00:04:50.038
NONVIOLENT REALM, NOT EVERYONE

00:04:50.039 --> 00:04:53.775
IN THERE IS THE GRIM REAPER.

00:04:53.776 --> 00:04:54.542
&gt;&gt; Greg: WE KNOW.

00:04:54.543 --> 00:04:56.277
YOU ARE ADDRESSING THE POINT

00:04:56.278 --> 00:04:58.446
THAT BERNIE HAS SCREWED UP SO

00:04:58.447 --> 00:04:58.780
BADLY.

00:04:58.781 --> 00:05:00.348
THE PROBLEM IS THERE'S A

00:05:00.349 --> 00:05:01.482
PERCEPTION OF THE LEFT THAT THEY

00:05:01.483 --> 00:05:03.718
ARE SOFT ON CRIME.

00:05:03.719 --> 00:05:05.453
THEY ARE ANTI-LAW ENFORCEMENT,

00:05:05.454 --> 00:05:07.121
LET'S FACE IT.

00:05:07.122 --> 00:05:07.722
ANTI-COPS, EVERYTHING.

00:05:07.723 --> 00:05:10.925
NO ONE TAKES IT SERIOUSLY.

00:05:10.926 --> 00:05:12.327
WHEN SOMEONE LIKE BERNIE SANDERS

00:05:12.328 --> 00:05:14.329
SAYS THAT, IT FULFILLS THE

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.263
STEREOTYPE AND IT'S A TERRIBLE

00:05:15.264 --> 00:05:15.730
THING TO RUN ON.

00:05:15.731 --> 00:05:19.767
IF A REPUBLICAN CAME UP AND SAID

00:05:19.768 --> 00:05:20.501
IT'S TIME FOR PRISON REFORM AND

00:05:20.502 --> 00:05:21.736
I'M INTERESTED IN THOSE

00:05:21.737 --> 00:05:22.537
NONVIOLENT OFFENDERS HAVING THE

00:05:22.538 --> 00:05:23.438
RIGHT TO VOTE.

00:05:23.439 --> 00:05:25.106
EVERYONE GOES, IT'S A

00:05:25.107 --> 00:05:25.506
REPUBLICAN.

00:05:25.507 --> 00:05:26.774
NORMALLY THEY ARE STRONG ON

00:05:26.775 --> 00:05:27.075
CRIME.

00:05:27.076 --> 00:05:29.143
MAYBE I WILL LISTEN TO THEM.

00:05:29.144 --> 00:05:30.745
IT'S A -- IT'S A PERCEPTION

00:05:30.746 --> 00:05:31.045
ISSUE.

00:05:31.046 --> 00:05:33.748
&gt;&gt; Dana: CAN I ADD ONE THING.

00:05:33.749 --> 00:05:34.716
SENATORS HEITKAMP AND DONNELLY

00:05:34.717 --> 00:05:36.818
WHO LOST IN THE MIDTERMS, THEY

00:05:36.819 --> 00:05:37.852
ARE DEMOCRATS, THEY ARE STARTING

00:05:37.853 --> 00:05:39.520
A NEW ENTITY TO TRY TO HELP

00:05:39.521 --> 00:05:40.221
DEMOCRATS TALK TO PEOPLE IN

00:05:40.222 --> 00:05:41.522
RURAL AMERICA.

00:05:41.523 --> 00:05:44.559
GUESS WHAT.

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:45.760
HERE'S YOUR FIRST LESSON.

00:05:45.761 --> 00:05:46.794
WHAT DID MAYOR PETE SAY WHEN HE

00:05:46.795 --> 00:05:48.897
WAS ASKED ON THAT SAME NIGHT IN

00:05:48.898 --> 00:05:50.331
THE CNN TOWN HALL, DO YOU THINK

00:05:50.332 --> 00:05:51.799
FELONS SHOULD HAVE THE RIGHT TO

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:52.734
VOTE WHILE THEY ARE

00:05:52.735 --> 00:05:53.167
INCARCERATED.

00:05:53.168 --> 00:05:53.568
HE SAID NO.

00:05:53.569 --> 00:05:56.337
THAT'S HOW YOU TALK TO PEOPLE IN

00:05:56.338 --> 00:05:56.671
AMERICA.

00:05:56.672 --> 00:05:57.672
&gt;&gt; Jesse: IN INDIANA.

00:05:57.673 --> 00:05:59.140
&gt;&gt; Greg: EVERYWHERE, FOR THAT

00:05:59.141 --> 00:06:00.375
MATTER.

00:06:00.376 --> 00:06:01.442
EXCEPT IN JAIL.

00:06:01.443 --> 00:06:03.311
&gt;&gt; Emily: THESE GUYS ARE

00:06:03.312 --> 00:06:04.279
COUNTED IN THE LEGISLATIVE

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:04.679
POPULATIONS.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.714
THAT'S THE OTHER THING.

00:06:06.715 --> 00:06:08.116
&gt;&gt; Dana: YOU HAVE YOUR FREEDOM

00:06:08.117 --> 00:06:09.217
TAKEN AWAY FROM YOU BECAUSE

00:06:09.218 --> 00:06:11.219
YOU'RE A NOT ALLOWED MOVEMENT.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.554
YOU CANNOT LEAVE.

00:06:13.555 --> 00:06:14.923
I DON'T SEE THE DIFFERENCE

00:06:14.924 --> 00:06:17.091
BETWEEN SAYING THAT YOU ALSO

00:06:17.092 --> 00:06:18.059
THEN CAN'T VOTE.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:18.726
&gt;&gt; Greg: EXACTLY.

00:06:18.727 --> 00:06:20.895
I SHOULD BE ABLE TO HAVE MY GUN

00:06:20.896 --> 00:06:21.162
TOO.

00:06:21.163 --> 00:06:21.896
I WANT MY VOTING RIGHTS IN MY

00:06:21.897 --> 00:06:24.966
GUN RIGHTS.

00:06:24.967 --> 00:06:28.770
[ALL SPEAKING]

00:06:28.771 --> 00:06:30.872
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU CAN'T HAVE AN

00:06:30.873 --> 00:06:31.739
HONEST CONVERSATION --

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.942
&gt;&gt; Greg: YEAH, WE ARE ALL

00:06:33.943 --> 00:06:34.442
LIARS.

00:06:34.443 --> 00:06:35.043
&gt;&gt; Jesse: CHANGING THE

00:06:35.044 --> 00:06:35.376
SUBJECT.

00:06:35.377 --> 00:06:37.211
&gt;&gt; Greg: WE ARE NOT CHANGING

00:06:37.212 --> 00:06:38.913
THE SUBJECT.

00:06:38.914 --> 00:06:39.580
&gt;&gt; Juan: IT'S ABOUT GIVING

00:06:39.581 --> 00:06:44.253
PRISONERS GUNS, YOU UNDERSTAND

